        <mxCell id="B3caV1MSY92Kg7Ig09u_-16" value="&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: pre; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;多模态传感数据复杂、驾驶规则隐式且依赖场景，传统模块化感知 - 规划 - 控制架构依赖人工规则、泛化性差&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
