        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B3caV1MSY92Kg7Ig09u_-96" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;现有安全评估&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; text-align: start; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;只看 “是否碰撞”&lt;/span&gt;，不区分碰撞严重程度，安全信号粗糙&lt;/font&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
