        <mxCell id="B3caV1MSY92Kg7Ig09u_-178" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; text-align: left; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Occ-LLM 融合预处理:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; text-align: start; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;Patchify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;：参考 ViT，将隐空间分块压平，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; text-align: start; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;最优块大小 = 10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;，平衡细节与效率。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; text-align: start; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;帧分隔符&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;：给每帧占据隐向量加&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: start; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;occ&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; text-align: start; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); display: inline; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/occ&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;标记，解决时序位置漂移&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;预融合:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;用 MLP 编码自车动作，加权调制占据特征，强化动作 - 场景关联&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
