        <mxCell id="B3caV1MSY92Kg7Ig09u_-209" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;VFM 驱动语义超像素生成，&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;SAM/SEEM/X-Decoder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;生成&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;语义一致&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;的超像素，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: start; background-color: initial; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;解决过分割与自冲突，让 2D-3D 对齐更准&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1150" y="4630" width="520" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B3caV1MSY92Kg7Ig09u_-210" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;font: 400 16px / 24px ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-align: start; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;VFM 辅助跨模态对比学习，打2D超像素投影到3D生成超点&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;在统一嵌入空间做对比损失，让图像语义知识蒸馏到点云&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1150" y="4730" width="520" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B3caV1MSY92Kg7Ig09u_-211" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;超点时序一致性，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;用 RANSAC+HDBSCAN 做 3D 几何聚类&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;强制同一物体在连续帧特征一致，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;不依赖完美相机 - 激光雷达同步&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1150" y="4840" width="520" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
